#: f5039abdd678418c9d6db914b298097d
msgid "Connect Mission Planner to AutoPilot"
msgstr "将 Mission Planner 连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:7
#: 9839d5edaa2b4ac985e484be960628f3 a4f5dd23fb95468486fa79dd855e0963
#: bbdd4cdb742d4389a2d7bb27f1bcce5d cfc5234175644c6792357601eac52b7e
#: d66918218f2d49238478523e5c1f07ea ebc4967f83e34300ad2f1daa78274acf
#: fb216b93ce5043ed91217858bb894f77
msgid ""
"This article explains how to connect *Mission Planner* to an autopilot in "
"order to receive telemetry and control the vehicle."
msgstr "本文介绍如何将 *Mission Planner* 连接到飞控，以接收数传数据并控制飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:12
#: 0832eb21befe4e1ab0a54a132c2f0a8e 5cda3120348a4b9d8856fbfe9a4041ca
#: 64b5176dde8f498f8a13cd409fb9bd5e 74ab960a870c45b8935ac0ffbee0fa2a
#: 9cf3ba7c5d47499eaa666785349da288 b5bc5ae7fa2042a48b5ad908ae271cda
#: e0c1d96431ed4d409f19b04f7d27b502
msgid ""
"There are separate instructions for connecting in order to :ref:`Load "
"Firmware <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` for existing ArduPilot "
"firmware installations, or for boards :ref:`without existing ArduPilot "
"firmware <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`."
msgstr ""
"有关为 :ref:`加载固件 <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` 连接现有 ArduPilot "
"固件安装的单独说明，或适用于 :ref:`没有现有 ArduPilot 固件的板子 <common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards>` 的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:16
#: 4e9ad86a12544614a3866b73a45b5697 52622cb1dcc94f4db843e7f7a7c21491
#: 725c64dfb466454eaabe7d4a41248b22 801086dae02840b8a7c0146c6379cbd0
#: 823513be2f904f2e86a77b9f45e20e06 9be6c89c75d04a6f8c21dda4aef966b4
#: ba2a88b9f4864a489bc93ecb674c62cd
msgid "Setting up the connection"
msgstr "设置连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:18
#: 00869a5395104691afb1035913a15688 b40be6cf4f104186b298951954c1fcf4
#: baccd385d97a418da2b1544fb1d94af1 c9e6b687d5104ddaa1a6d646929ba29a
#: d011ba8ae9a748ffac6a15872a37af62 f13d18b25cae4a868bde3a00b3369ce2
#: fdf8f5f2edd94030a04dbe06d277b36d
msgid ""
"To establish a connection you must first choose the communication "
"method/channel you want to use, and then set up the physical hardware and "
"Windows device drivers. You can connect the PC and autopilot using USB "
"cables, :ref:`Telemetry Radios <copter:common-telemetry-landingpage>`, "
":ref:`Bluetooth <common-mission-planner-bluetooth-"
"connectivity_detailed_connecting_with_mission_planner>`, IP connections etc."
msgstr ""
"要建立连接，您必须先选择要使用的通信方法/通道，然后设置物理硬件和 Windows 设备驱动程序。您可以使用 USB 线缆、:ref:`数传电台 "
"<copter:common-telemetry-landingpage>`、:ref:`蓝牙 <common-mission-planner-"
"bluetooth-connectivity_detailed_connecting_with_mission_planner>`、IP 连接等方式连接"
" PC 和飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:27
#: 112b7f7dcd07401489dd1b4e676dfb71 5fb65da28d6e42dd8504f26a934b172a
#: 8a8875d53c224622bed78f675a14deff a872b8b360e54183a87caf32c2e28ae1
#: adba3d81d43d400abd05dae29a1f1a3f b714e7182dd04eb8927fbe5a51710935
#: be458d89feff4015a15a81ed6539ea0c
msgid ""
"The driver for your connection hardware must be present on Windows as this "
"makes your connection's COM port and default data rate available to *Mission"
" Planner*."
msgstr ""
"连接硬件的驱动程序必须在 Windows 上存在，因为这会使连接的 COM 端口和默认数据速率对 *Mission Planner* 可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:35
#: 0bf30c73b86340cf9fc581f876b005e1 33380422c53144af98dad45312d5d019
#: 59f5304e7c224bd4835ef78f0f9ea285 6574b203e2d54c058aed811dc45f8da9
#: ba4254dfa32849539136da765a3b67c1 d66bcf559a3343c793b0b78edc5a34c6
#: df1ed58aa6e541778ac49c36fe1cb4c1
msgid "Pixhawk USB Connection"
msgstr "Pixhawk USB 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:41
#: 28f8ec212ea94000b0a0dafca263f558 2bd43f234e574a3cbb8991d80e2402c5
#: 54b17f5e34574be19891250859ad870a 5606d5c00f5746039968c345440967cf
#: 92d0ead5f11144a28ccf52c67f200a0d d2d1b39b84444155a477bec8b082a392
#: f3741554f5bd45f2ae41bb7d1f9120ad
msgid "Connection using SiK Radio"
msgstr "使用 SiK 电台连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:43
#: 0f8da3fa704d4a0d8f3c978884be0d7a 17211ff6b6904bc98bd170781e7e9e9d
#: 3dc5d2e05ef04cc68afc1974fa9a433e 835ed1d2db9a4ac4b5ff554c49010475
#: 8bc9b59661944c169eaf65768e374cef bd59907bf5164dffb3d109f520a2f36d
#: f4765bbbc6854f41b511961b87eb6a45
msgid ""
"On *Mission Planner*, the connection and data rate are set up using the drop"
" down boxes in the upper right portion of the screen."
msgstr "在 *Mission Planner* 中，连接和数据速率通过屏幕右上角的下拉框进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:49
#: 0b4fa4d5abdf4d67abbeab03add881fa 91798eb74819457bbe1ac497ebeb2684
#: a32524b8913e49db8b5b1863be43e98a bac5cccfcdfb49b880a64af6334112d6
#: c774c6731aed44b3933d1314fa4cf7e9 e24b1adeb1a24410aa312dc407e091de
#: ecb2e5d25d364391acbe58e9420afa52
msgid ""
"Once you've attached the USB or Telemetry Radio, Windows will automatically "
"assign your autopilot a COM port number, and that will show in the drop-down"
" menu (the actual number does not matter). The appropriate data rate for the"
" connection is also set (typically the USB connection data rate is 115200 "
"and the radio connection rate is 57600)."
msgstr ""
"连接 USB 或数传电台后，Windows 会自动为您的飞控分配 COM "
"端口号，该号码将显示在下拉菜单中（实际号码无关紧要）。连接对应的数据速率也会设置（通常 USB 连接数据速率为 115200，无线电连接速率为 "
"57600）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:55
#: 0e674c496b1c40ed883a9593edfbce1f 1afd6d45a9c04e339ce112e759a04aec
#: 21bcc38b659c4c9ca22136aadc425e8b 47f7f3c8231a419b906d8f530c2ad279
#: 7df62e916b4c4fb5aac8b17e7c1a283e 8823a969274f48eeb4c76596edbe1b4d
#: e77820342673467e8bee6b24340a26ab
msgid ""
"Select the desired port and data rate and then press the **CONNECT** button "
"to connect to the autopilot. After connecting **Mission Planner** will "
"download parameters from the autopilot and the button will change to "
"**DISCONNECT** as shown:"
msgstr ""
"选择所需端口和数据速率，然后按 **CONNECT** 按钮连接到飞控。连接后，**Mission Planner** 将从飞控下载参数，按钮将变为 "
"**DISCONNECT**，如图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:65
#: 07f77dd7ea9f4c26a57c150c5ccdd14d 3bafb6c7e689447db19ba316d4ac2ffc
#: 55350f1f58d343ff84a72cdf25fb55e7 771ab94d09ee4b5fb889156723a5a7b2
#: b6712a4a90e14efebb0a6f6092c4670c d0d195ac6d374c97bf6b934960fb2c70
#: ef406b0a26704bd6be2aae7dccd2ea49
msgid ""
"The \"select port\" dropdown also contains TCP or UDP port options that can "
"be used to connect to an autopilot over a network."
msgstr "「选择端口」下拉菜单还包含 TCP 或 UDP 端口选项，可用于通过网络连接到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:68
#: 61cf4ce963b74ee9b0d2a0bd460d50b9 65b23f41ea6c49f3b74c8ea044dbf4f5
#: 664ade882c0348359b3d6a48e32ed54b 6fb728ec47644778887ca585147c2487
#: 7e37809e87fc47bb9868cd057fbf4561 96a1ec69d8204223ac219c0600d2d827
#: 9d1a34ada63f4184b16129cf53676028
msgid ""
"The \"Stats...\" hotlink beneath the port selection box, if clicked, will "
"give information about the connection, such as if :ref:`Signing "
"security<common-MAVLink2-signing>` is active, link stats, etc. Sometimes "
"this window pops up beneath the current screen and will have to be brought "
"to the front to be seen."
msgstr ""
"端口选择框下方的「Stats...」超链接（如果单击）将提供有关连接的信息，例如 :ref:`签名安全<common-"
"MAVLink2-signing>` 是否激活、链路统计信息等。有时此窗口会弹出在当前屏幕下方，需要将其移到前台才能看到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:74
#: 198efa405813444581605a7ef2afab7f 7394a5f3819d401082289d5f131e9fdb
#: 87d35d545d6240ce9eae6d9a23a3f7b0 a82340a8c415415c94e2416d2564d52a
#: be2545c28f354030b4ccb661d8ce19a6 e6951ed7ac7d4f7eace619672f416eee
#: f75ca359f4c14280a04ab0fd62c0f1cd
msgid "Connecting to multiple vehicles"
msgstr "连接多个飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:75
#: 687ab81e211a4b2bb6d259cd601ce2d2 6b967c2aa2c2498fbc15eebbb2fa25a4
#: 7260b094e359414990c3dac00cbdea63 8610d8dd5fb84ea08973dd98fe6205b0
#: bd3f8c2f441c47c3aa485dee89091c81 e125bc93f5014946aff319e4a4d553f2
#: e24f396716bb4158a85d9cd8c301d898
msgid ""
"Additional connections can be made by right-clicking the **CONNECT** button "
"and selecting **Connection Options** from the drop-down list."
msgstr "可以通过右键单击 **CONNECT** 按钮并从下拉列表中选择 **Connection Options** 来进行额外连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:80
#: 1dc558507e41403197a4090bcfe6f99f 2316d995e26e4a21a1d0caf30d349199
#: 84f914f6e8cd4fc89d6347e6298009f7 8b71f006887546bda9cfdc8610262b2d
#: ad8a86b6b71a483898fe4b0d6d8956ce f01bc7e46c5b49fe9ea6373093c887d4
#: f73a1d5c66b644f388e2a036514ed76f
msgid ""
"A file with a pre-written list of connections can be loaded with the "
"**Connection List** drop-down option. This is an example format of the file:"
msgstr "可以使用 **Connection List** 下拉选项加载包含预写连接列表的文件。以下是文件格式示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:90
#: 252635d1e38b4c8f8cf237d9f256d9fd 2a65914de24547638b8f48f3f82242ef
#: 5d86d234029f45b3bccda460e772f79c 69c0e8128d36405296c2e0eafe7dc8cb
#: 8d8e9985b9a2487d8f28bad32b72cf50 d3e9a0e369ea40cdbfe4c3b3cf806758
#: d5f3b3c99c8f4e34a9af2e5b8dfb83f3
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:92
#: 1cde3ba91cbc43cf80e5eb3a22a5bdec 7c27963e104646f1a7654b8a4f5c4b4a
#: 91822c67623a4ef6b7db8fac92234a1c aed462124a7448d78543ff06bd586e37
#: cbf755de6dd5445da84e93e71b752cbb fa5175ef44704f76a7989de54222e573
#: fc05a94a0bfe4303aaf9ab8a3b5d897f
msgid "If Mission Planner is unable to connect:"
msgstr "如果 Mission Planner 无法连接："

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:94
#: 02aec1f43f234d819b2638fb240dee9e 3cc2e605208549abbddf8796a55c1ed5
#: 55ece2f499f34732a749047f74b5c857 5ca7f485440f48e3bf1650b6648e528e
#: 9f173f782c824d6dadc8267d116f8235 e9c0a70ee108447a92799274ed0ef34e
#: fcf65e423fc94037b8970ca98c533116
msgid ""
"Check that the correct baud rate is used for the selected method (115200 on "
"USB or 57600 on Radio/Telemetry)"
msgstr "检查所选方法使用的波特率是否正确（USB 为 115200，无线电/数传为 57600）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:96
#: 33fbf18e73cf4986a12123b0f9ee996f 626845e4e9e7459a981a552153842159
#: 8924faa31e4447c2b70f644ea8311cae a7ba22ab7859447fbd3313ffe7c132a2
#: b0043c3aba1a4436baacf01a845e8f2d d1efb47b23b14e5585347f1312daeddb
#: f264c37c043442889e8763df26dd25a6
msgid ""
"If attaching via USB, be sure that a few seconds after power up have passed "
"before attempting to connect. If you attempted to connect during the "
"bootloader initialization time, Windows may get the wrong USB information. "
"Connection attempts after this may require that the USB connection be  "
"unplugged and re-plugged,then wait for bootloader to enter the main code ( "
"few seconds), then attempt the connection. Occasionally, MP must be "
"restarted if an attempt to connect is made while in the bootloader "
"initialization period."
msgstr ""
"如果通过 USB 连接，请确保通电后等待几秒钟再尝试连接。如果您在引导程序初始化期间尝试连接，Windows 可能获取错误的 USB "
"信息。此后的连接尝试可能需要拔出并重新插入 USB "
"连接，然后等待引导程序进入主代码（几秒钟），再尝试连接。如果在引导程序初始化期间尝试连接，偶尔可能需要重启 Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:97
#: 570b175ce605456fb9a5a9f8191cd0b8 8e2a4a68d09743afadd3b26f05d79bde
#: a00baaff1ef94e279483c1cebbf79a67 aaba8ac693254b96809bd21742a3f4e2
#: b94ed289595440bfa52fd9adfa0dd303 f2ff57696c574b249001bf844915d95f
#: f4beb02d4d124279a58c6c4cde2bc5b2
msgid ""
"If using a COM port on Windows, check that the connection's COM port exists "
"in the Windows Device Manager's list of serial ports."
msgstr "如果在 Windows 上使用 COM 端口，请检查连接的 COM 端口是否存在于 Windows 设备管理器的串行端口列表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:99
#: 2234fe69238e4e5f9cfbe31125817bc9 2f27168a4a1341d383ce5617ebeef701
#: 3a588a57acad4e38953f904be6f2c41b 84d83cc1054d4500b3e1ddb5e91bc0dc
#: a28066e96bd646bba3ec2676c814cddc c833c72ea9bf46ffa3859f9b24625017
#: d7ffca9f069b43d7a5487b68f7f5acc3
msgid ""
"If your autopilot has an F7 or H7 processor and has CAN ports, then see the "
"section below, :ref:`Troubleshooting Composite Connections <troubleshooting-"
"composite-connections>`"
msgstr ""
"如果您的飞控具有 F7 或 H7 处理器并有 CAN 端口，请参见以下部分 :ref:`复合连接故障排除 <troubleshooting-"
"composite-connections>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:100
#: 0862119f5d794effbfcfe576f823f908 4f9e9244c4b64d548f75d2001543186f
#: 766fbf3909154e5598deb77ef822c5d3 9107c619b4764efa8a1def3ee04f5af6
#: d74b65e4df9347dd999f44056a0ee86f de4841530a6f4ff1b6098851f9099832
#: ec5f43d0e0954c75be6f72b3ce592cbe
msgid "If using a USB port, try a different physical USB port"
msgstr "如果使用 USB 端口，请尝试不同的物理 USB 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:101
#: 0ed540d24a58402eaa2136173fcf8a01 17b7066c54fc40abb2a16cf001641190
#: 5681b10ab0364aea88f39e120f10b417 8f63c468e5334246ac23fc32ac9f0fa7
#: aa81ec3a02bd4223a9cde9dd5bf0c5d2 f1dd1a3b06d74b6f8158548d780a99c1
#: f2876c786b5e48abbd56033c6a1787e1
msgid ""
"If using a UDP or TCP connection, check that your firewall is not blocking "
"IP traffic"
msgstr "如果使用 UDP 或 TCP 连接，请检查防火墙是否未阻止 IP 流量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:103
#: 28ab3459a8f142b9b3d5044b855f191c 355a65025b144bd394fcbd1d58836824
#: 3dd1057b2a274e90a0bfb4d8af8b4399 455a8c6995e7443a8b8928c52c7ba8e8
#: 46ac3acda813443a8020a5a938d8b6eb 515d269c6f114bc7bba9c14ba492e3e1
#: c2505f417dfe4441b6711d1814366253
msgid ""
"You should also ensure that the autopilot controller board has appropriate "
"ArduPilot firmware installed and has booted correctly (on Pixhawk there are "
"useful :ref:`LEDs <common-leds-pixhawk>` and :ref:`Sounds <common-sounds-"
"pixhawkpx4>` which can tell you the state of the autopilot)."
msgstr ""
"您还应确保飞控板已安装适当的 ArduPilot 固件并已正确启动（在 Pixhawk 上有有用的 :ref:`LED <common-leds-"
"pixhawk>` 和 :ref:`声音 <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 可以告知飞控状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:108
#: 2d514c1e494e4f82bd17398c21ccdcd6 5330049dac044b12b66c8a1cdc5eff8f
#: 74c321bfe585465aadf1f18e1269d1f0 79244e13646c43b38561533b8af6b75d
#: a71a61f4be2549ffae716431ae449033 d11748ba86ca4619957d5b2cf0aba33a
#: d7bdb6d7738a40bdb9c9949f0c353581
msgid ""
"If using a remote link (not USB) and Mission Planner connects, but does not "
"download parameters or you cannot get commands, like mode changes acted "
"upon,then the autopilot probably has Signing turned on. See :ref:`common-"
"MAVLink2-signing`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用远程链接（非 USB）且 Mission Planner 已连接，但未下载参数或无法使模式更改等命令生效，则飞控可能已开启签名。请参阅 "
":ref:`common-MAVLink2-signing`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:113
#: 3cec49acbf5545a8bb2a215d6b382cab 49db0ee1f9324929b68743b6dd53127f
#: 6a3e5399bb434993905f3b4004254e7d 6d7edd4dca7f425d93979e7eeb34e8e8
#: 9500ad8a518246548af0b93b2e19ab19 99fe30c426144653af2031b936d30341
#: bdb423055adc45f984f5f7620ac16576
msgid "Troubleshooting Composite Connections"
msgstr "复合连接故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:115
#: 0d788936b66b48cbaba0a3e9bb505ddb 1c90a006ecd345a38e6d12e44305aa63
#: 1f84c853676b4d7eb34b9cb3f3c85a3d 35a6f70057894af0ab8d1dcc37199dc6
#: 6fe6537752064412baccb02cf57e2a6c ab888cf48071480b82b9a0585df0dbae
#: ca9a3c3e595d4481abfee6c5a6baf650
msgid ""
"Autopilots with F7 or H7 processors and having CAN interfaces use firmware "
"that presents two USB interfaces: One for the normal MAVLink connection, and"
" one for SLCAN serial connections to the CAN interface for configuration and"
" firmware updates.This is called a composite USB device."
msgstr ""
"具有 F7 或 H7 处理器且有 CAN 接口的飞控使用的固件呈现两个 USB 接口：一个用于普通 MAVLink 连接，另一个用于通过 CAN "
"接口进行配置和固件更新的 SLCAN 串行连接。这称为复合 USB 设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:117
#: 2651cb854cbb415abd48106a8b02910d 26b74fe2b423410ba3423f8ff28c6a71
#: 40ea2cc4d0154fde92bea51c6cda91e8 618518246c7c42e19007133d7a39cd71
#: 7fa78dae3dd949ed8c71a42e5891dd5d 97dc003ff28748bea0ab46102b4b5308
#: 9f96a08d2c474cb1801532de425698f2
msgid ""
"By default, the MAVLink USB interface is SERIAL0 and the SLCAN USB interface"
" is the highest SERIALx port the board presents. The Windows driver "
"currently installed with Mission Planner may select to use either one, and "
"since both are set by default in ArduPilot firmware for MAVLINK protocol, it"
" will work fine, whichever one it chooses as the COM port."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，MAVLink USB 接口为 SERIAL0，SLCAN USB 接口为板子呈现的最高编号 SERIALx 端口。随 Mission "
"Planner 安装的 Windows 驱动程序目前可能选择使用其中任意一个，由于两者默认在 ArduPilot 固件中设置为 MAVLINK "
"协议，无论选择哪个作为 COM 端口都可以正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:119
#: 1f38a715a57d4c0298f28148c40b0401 26a1cce2f5564356a501bcf732c0e2c2
#: 40a7b9351cc743989b8cfbc59897d454 9af8bc55db23414fadf1d51695d095ee
#: b303b61126044ccab00581b852b5dd3c b50d54c515f44279a6a62bd97195775e
#: d49252004a5240329033ca2c05d8f6a1
msgid ""
"However, there is a situation where the user will find that it will not "
"connect to the obvious COM port in the Mission Planner dropdown box.This "
"occurs when the user accidentally changes the protocol of whichever SERIALx "
"port the Windows driver is using as the MAVLink COM port to something other "
"than MAVLink. This can easily happen if the user takes an existing parameter"
" file from a vehicle configuration used with a different autopilot that has "
"the protocol changed. For example, the user has a plane with non F7/H7 CAN "
"capable autopilot and upgrades it to one that is, then loads his existing "
"parameter file while setting up the plane with the new autopilot. As soon as"
" the parameter file is loaded and the autopilot is rebooted, communication "
"is lost and cannot be re-established."
msgstr ""
"但是，有一种情况下用户会发现无法连接到 Mission Planner 下拉框中明显的 COM 端口。当用户意外将 Windows 驱动程序用作 "
"MAVLink COM 端口的 SERIALx 端口的协议更改为 MAVLink "
"以外的协议时，就会发生这种情况。如果用户从不同飞控配置的飞行器中获取已更改协议的现有参数文件并加载，则很容易发生这种情况。例如，用户有一架使用非 "
"F7/H7 CAN 飞控的飞机，将其升级为 F7/H7 CAN "
"飞控，然后在使用新飞控设置飞机时加载现有参数文件。参数文件加载并重启飞控后，通信立即中断且无法重新建立。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:121
#: 1bce688a01e04f70ba0a5e53470c4562 3b9917b56b3747808a715303089dc252
#: 58bdd718ddba4783861e2a0faf536343 965ca37093c5494fa9bd919ce78cf66f
#: c5e65c9b24d741bbad22846935cb44ef f6a90a0bb62d4a59b11bd5f42a8d8790
#: faae2c6adf8a48729fbbc208af702f86
msgid ""
"What has occurred, is that the protocol for the SERIALx port that Windows "
"was using has been changed. Almost always, this is the highest numbered "
"SERIALx port since that is commonly set to -1 on non-CAN capable autopilots,"
" and the Windows COM port driver has selected this interface as the COM port"
" instead of SERIAL0."
msgstr ""
"发生的情况是 Windows 使用的 SERIALx 端口的协议被更改了。几乎总是最高编号的 SERIALx 端口，因为在非 CAN 飞控上通常设置为 "
"-1，Windows COM 端口驱动程序将此接口而不是 SERIAL0 选为 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:123
#: 0b57533a2a2f4962bbc1a64b4c8cca7f 3220d206685d4fd0807739e6ba7c5b65
#: 6535b8c7738b4682a51c560ed8c08ff3 8878361c1b004ac3a076af5d8a862e50
#: a3d3ea01e90e4413a7897e7f76c193d6 c1a1c13ca92244a9b9042c02d40f8133
#: ff7ef3c41c4746e0bbb5e7edf8ae01ca
msgid "The procedure to recover is as follows:"
msgstr "恢复步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:127
#: 7523c50eb0e74a418a0248993afdbab7 9df3fd8518474236a313d92dbe296c01
#: a61fe6a07a22433a8b44e120c9d5b3be c4656e87332442c6965baa658a49c414
#: c68eefafe86c4877883979e170ee9388 c85a82a43629492d99b1e1f5e4e54cac
#: d3fea2cb9a7348fa8518964ea5409ee7
msgid ""
"Go to Windows Device Manager and find the COM port being used by the "
"autopilot in the Ports listings. It will have the COM Port # you used to "
"connect initially to Mission Planner. Right click and it will present "
"\"Update driver software\" as one of the options. Click it."
msgstr ""
"进入 Windows 设备管理器，在端口列表中找到飞控使用的 COM 端口。它将具有您最初连接到 Mission Planner 时使用的 COM "
"端口号。右键单击，将显示「更新驱动程序软件」选项。单击它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:131
#: 88f31575641044adb8adef58b3e09394 91bf48861f1e4af58cf4a00c660f218a
#: 941bd25689044102ae32dae2ce3917f2 a2668e91a5f94395bab35d507407d5e6
#: ba04aca8442a44beb58e8070f647dd47 d5bfa297268c4bdfa3b7bb726febf714
#: d7e573cdd1814dc2a9156a166b54c273
msgid ""
"Click the \"Browse my computer......\" option and then click the \"Choose "
"from a list...\" option and you will see this screen:"
msgstr "单击「浏览我的计算机......」选项，然后单击「从列表中选择...」选项，您将看到此界面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:135
#: 51650b1cdf5b41cdabe846b8909eedcc 76923691dfb1430c9c2ac0ccb4a4467e
#: 93bb42bd0b7043fc90b30dcc96758af7 b05d1f70080845cf9662f01f35552f1d
#: b250c61e9874430ea522bcfe464a1a2b bd81efd5ba934406ac64c13bd4156f16
#: d9e608b849334e7282fb9fe451b90c3d
msgid ""
"Scroll down the top list until \"Composite USB\" option appears and click "
"it."
msgstr "向下滚动顶部列表，直到出现「Composite USB」选项并单击它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:137
#: 5595985ece164be49bc563e83869c767 681b45a680414626ba67d04e63ff8873
#: 70c36d5f415a43a2bdfef879b84fae6a 8661ee159028403fbaaef5da8d09c871
#: b2eeb31220d34494b6aa8dc37c6f2ce9 ed03c86a9e8d40008e5cd5a610a4e6ce
#: fa7a6aa6b66344a3b7b9c1897bea686b
msgid ""
"Now reconnect your autopilot to the PC and two COM ports will be presented. "
"One will connect (the remaining one with MAVLink Protocol) and the other "
"will not. If you do not connect to one, try the other. But DO NOT disconnect"
" the autopilot from the PC or the composite driver will unload and you will "
"have to start over."
msgstr ""
"现在重新连接飞控到 PC，将呈现两个 COM 端口。一个会连接（仍使用 MAVLink 协议的那个），另一个不会。如果一个不能连接，尝试另一个。但请勿从"
" PC 断开飞控，否则复合驱动程序将卸载，您将不得不重新开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:139
#: 18fe2be680724167bc9e24b14d22489b 2e48bf8d48af4005b9587760e139c276
#: 4c85d4f512144b50a6a2c31c8c6a585d 88e886f8a8794cdebfd95324a93a1c33
#: a671684663154c018942b2fadf07882c a994116069794e7bb6fb363adb50ed28
#: dd08d42f000f4189843546e9b64a04d8
msgid ""
"Now that you are connected to Mission Planner, change back the protocol of "
"the Serialx port protocol to 2 (MAVLink2). You can now disconnect and "
"reconnect the autopilot and it will present only one COM port and you should"
" be able to connect from now on. Do not change this protocol from now on "
"unless trying to utilize the SLCAN interface. It may be a bit unfamiliar "
"since the Mission Planner SERIALx port being used is no longer the normal "
"SERIAL0 but rather,the highest port, but this does not affect anything in "
"the autopilot's configuration and operation."
msgstr ""
"现在已连接到 Mission Planner，将 Serialx 端口协议改回 2（MAVLink2）。现在您可以断开并重新连接飞控，它将只呈现一个 "
"COM 端口，之后应该可以正常连接。除非尝试使用 SLCAN 接口，否则不要再次更改此协议。由于 Mission Planner 使用的 SERIALx"
" 端口不再是通常的 SERIAL0 而是最高端口，这可能有点陌生，但这不会影响飞控的任何配置和操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot.rst:143
#: 1d4cbad5cca3452e9bde2b7d1b83f96e 775f75d95f8b4fde986ce53f0befa373
